|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Vladimir Kochnev** | 331 (54.4%) | 400 (54.6%) | 2015-09-18 | inactive |
| Marco Silva | 117 (19.2%) | 143 (19.5%) | 2026-08-03 | active |
| Alexander Yunin | 55 (9.0%) | 61 (8.3%) | 2016-07-04 | inactive |
