- Kochnev and Madsen are both inactive, and together hold 32% of the lines. dblock has the most commits and also appears under other names (Daniel Doubrovkine), which the tool already counts as one person.
- 276 lines credited to Brian van de Boogaard were committed by peter scholz. The lines count for Brian, not for peter.

